@startuml Data Flow - Write Operation

title 데이터 쓰기 흐름 (Create Release Note)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10

box "UI Layer" #E3F2FD
    participant "CreateScreen" as Screen
    participant "CreateViewModel" as VM
    participant "StateFlow<UiState>" as State
end box

box "Domain Layer" #FFF3E0
    participant "CreateReleaseNoteUseCase" as UseCase
    participant "ReleaseNoteRepository\n(interface)" as Repo
end box

box "Data Layer" #E8F5E9
    participant "RepositoryImpl" as RepoImpl
    participant "RemoteDataSource" as Remote
    participant "LocalDataSource" as Local
    participant "Mapper" as Mapper
end box

box "External" #FFE0B2
    participant "Server API" as API
    database "Cache DB" as DB
end box

== 생성 프로세스 ==

Screen -> Screen : User fills form\nand clicks "Create"

Screen -> VM : createReleaseNote(note)
activate VM

VM -> State : emit(UiState.Loading)
State --> Screen : show loading indicator

VM -> UseCase : invoke(note)
activate UseCase

UseCase -> Repo : createReleaseNote(note)
activate RepoImpl

' Convert to DTO
RepoImpl -> Mapper : toDto(note)
Mapper --> RepoImpl : ReleaseNoteDto

' Send to server
RepoImpl -> Remote : createReleaseNote(dto)
activate Remote
Remote -> API : POST /api/release-notes\n{body: dto}
API --> Remote : ReleaseNoteDto (with id)
deactivate Remote

alt Success
    ' Convert response
    RepoImpl -> Mapper : toDomain(responseDto)
    Mapper --> RepoImpl : ReleaseNote (with id)
    
    ' Update local cache
    RepoImpl -> Local : saveNote(note)
    activate Local
    Local -> DB : INSERT INTO notes
    deactivate Local
    
    RepoImpl --> UseCase : Result.Success(note)
    UseCase --> VM : Result.Success(note)
    
    VM -> State : emit(UiState.Success(note))
    State --> Screen : navigate to detail or list
    
else Network Error
    RepoImpl --> UseCase : Result.Error("Network error")
    UseCase --> VM : Result.Error(message)
    
    VM -> State : emit(UiState.Error(message))
    State --> Screen : show error dialog
end

deactivate RepoImpl
deactivate UseCase
deactivate VM

note over Screen
    성공 시: 다른 화면으로 이동
    실패 시: 에러 메시지 표시
end note

== Optimistic Update (선택적) ==

note over RepoImpl
    즉시 로컬 캐시에 저장하고
    UI 업데이트 후 서버 동기화
    
    네트워크 실패 시 롤백
end note

@enduml
